# S4 (Amendment S §5, E §9.2): the distant ground as smooth height fields shaded with the near
# ground's materials, canopies over far stands, snow by the near cover's seasons, and the land
# out to the real horizon. Kept in docs/review/s4/ (as JPEGs). The near/far transition: `top`
# looks down on the full-detail square (128 blocks) in its LOD; `ground` stands in it.
# `hearth --screenshot-list tools/shots/s4_distant.shots`
